        "meta_keywords": ["Rudraksha mala", "Rudraksha benefits", "how to wear Rudraksha mala", "Rudraksha care tips", "spiritual jewelry", "meditation beads", "Rudraksha mala for beginners", "energy beads", "mantra chanting"],
        "data": "<div style=\"font-family:sans-serif; line-height:1.7;\"><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:16px;\">Rudraksha Malas are not just spiritual accessories, but sacred energizing tools that can bring peace, focus, protection, and spirituality to daily life. For centuries, saints, yogis, and devotees have worn Rudraksha Malas for meditation and mantra chanting.</p><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:16px;\">In this easy-to-read guide, you’ll learn:</p><ul style=\"list-style:none; padding-left:0; margin-bottom:24px;\"><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:10px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">What a Rudraksha mala is</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:10px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Key benefits of Rudraksha Mala</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:10px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">How to wear it correctly</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:center;\"><span style=\"width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:10px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Simple care and maintenance tips</span></li></ul><h2 style=\"font-weight:700; font-size:20px; margin-top:32px; margin-bottom:16px;\">What is a Rudraksha Mala?</h2><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:16px;\">A Rudraksha Mala is a garland of sacred beads formed from the seeds of the Elaeocarpus Ganitrus tree.</p><h2 style=\"font-weight:700; font-size:20px; margin-top:32px; margin-bottom:16px;\">Features of Rudraksha Mala</h2><ul style=\"list-style:none; padding-left:0; margin-bottom:24px;\"><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:10px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Made up of 108 Beads + 1 Guru bead</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:10px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Used in meditation, japa, and daily wear</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:center;\"><span style=\"width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:10px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Each bead possesses natural vibrational energy</span></li></ul><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:16px;\">Pro tip: The Guru bead represents wisdom and completeness and must never be crossed during chanting.</p><h2 style=\"font-weight:700; font-size:20px; margin-top:32px; margin-bottom:16px;\">What are the Benefits of Wearing a Rudraksha Mala?</h2><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:16px;\">Rudraksha Mala offers mental, emotional, spiritual, and physical benefits.</p><h2 style=\"font-weight:700; font-size:20px; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:16px;\">Mental Benefits</h2><ul style=\"list-style:none; padding-left:0; margin-bottom:24px;\"><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:10px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Reduces stress and anxiety</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:10px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Calms an overactive mind</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:center;\"><span style=\"width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:10px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Improves concentration and focus</span></li></ul><h2 style=\"font-weight:700; font-size:20px; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:16px;\">Emotional Benefits</h2><ul style=\"list-style:none; padding-left:0; margin-bottom:24px;\"><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:10px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Promotes emotional stability</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:10px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Reduces anger and negativity</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:center;\"><span style=\"width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:10px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Encourages inner peace and confidence</span></li></ul><h2 style=\"font-weight:700; font-size:20px; margin-top:32px; margin-bottom:16px;\">How to Wear a Rudraksha Mala Correctly</h2><ul style=\"list-style:none; padding-left:0; margin-bottom:24px;\"><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:10px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Hold the mala in your right hand</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:10px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Use thumb and middle finger</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:10px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Avoid the index finger</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:center;\"><span style=\"width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:10px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Do not cross the Guru bead</span></li></ul><h2 style=\"font-weight:700; font-size:20px; margin-top:32px; margin-bottom:16px;\">Conclusion</h2><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:16px;\">A Rudraksha mala is more than jewelry — it is a spiritual companion that promotes inner growth, serenity, and clarity. When worn properly and cared for respectfully, it becomes a powerful part of your spiritual journey.</p><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px;\">Whether you seek protection, peace, or deeper meditation, a well-maintained Rudraksha mala can truly transform your experience.</p></div>"
