        "data": "<div style=\"font-family:sans-serif; line-height:1.8; color:#222;\"><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:20px;\">Confused about which rudraksha mala size fits you? The ideal size depends upon the purpose: daily wear, meditation, chanting, or spiritual healing. From the subtle 4mm rudraksha mala to the bold 20mm rudraksha mala, each size offers a distinctly different experience in comfort, appearance, and energy feel.</p><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:20px;\">The selection of the right size is not only about appearance but also about how it feels during meditation and how it reflects your spiritual identity.</p><h2 style=\"font-weight:700; font-size:20px; margin-top:40px; margin-bottom:20px;\">Why Does Rudraksha Mala Size Matter?</h2><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:16px;\">The size of the beads influences:</p><ul style=\"list-style:none; padding-left:0; margin-bottom:24px;\"><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:12px;\"><span style=\"min-width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;margin-top:7px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Comfort for daily wear</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:12px;\"><span style=\"min-width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;margin-top:7px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Weight around the neck</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:12px;\"><span style=\"min-width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;margin-top:7px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Ease of chanting (Japa)</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:12px;\"><span style=\"min-width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;margin-top:7px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Aesthetic appeal</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"min-width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;margin-top:7px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Spiritual presence and feel</span></li></ul><h2 style=\"font-weight:700; font-size:20px; margin-top:40px; margin-bottom:20px;\">4mm Rudraksha Mala: Minimal and Elegant</h2><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:16px;\">The smallest size available, perfect for subtle spiritual wear.</p><ul style=\"list-style:none; padding-left:0; margin-bottom:24px;\"><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:12px;\"><span style=\"min-width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;margin-top:7px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Extremely lightweight</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:12px;\"><span style=\"min-width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;margin-top:7px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Comfortable for long hours</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"min-width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;margin-top:7px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Ideal for office wear and layering</span></li></ul><h2 style=\"font-weight:700; font-size:20px; margin-top:40px; margin-bottom:20px;\">6mm Rudraksha Mala: Balanced and Practical</h2><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:16px;\">A slightly bigger but still comfortable size, ideal for beginners and regular mantra chanting.</p><ul style=\"list-style:none; padding-left:0; margin-bottom:24px;\"><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:12px;\"><span style=\"min-width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;margin-top:7px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Balanced visibility and comfort</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"min-width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;margin-top:7px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Traditional yet lightweight</span></li></ul><h2 style=\"font-weight:700; font-size:20px; margin-top:40px; margin-bottom:20px;\">8mm Rudraksha Mala: The Most Popular Size</h2><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:16px;\">The standard meditation size and most versatile option.</p><ul style=\"list-style:none; padding-left:0; margin-bottom:24px;\"><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:12px;\"><span style=\"min-width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;margin-top:7px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Easy to hold during japa</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:12px;\"><span style=\"min-width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;margin-top:7px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Balanced weight</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"min-width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;margin-top:7px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Suitable for both daily wear and meditation</span></li></ul><h2 style=\"font-weight:700; font-size:20px; margin-top:40px; margin-bottom:20px;\">10mm Rudraksha Mala: Strong Spiritual Presence</h2><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:16px;\">Bold and noticeable, ideal for serious spiritual seekers.</p><ul style=\"list-style:none; padding-left:0; margin-bottom:24px;\"><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:12px;\"><span style=\"min-width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;margin-top:7px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Heavier than 8mm</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"min-width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;margin-top:7px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Makes a visible spiritual statement</span></li></ul><h2 style=\"font-weight:700; font-size:20px; margin-top:40px; margin-bottom:20px;\">20mm Rudraksha Mala: Powerful and Traditional</h2><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:16px;\">Large, bold, and traditionally worn by advanced practitioners.</p><ul style=\"list-style:none; padding-left:0; margin-bottom:24px;\"><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:12px;\"><span style=\"min-width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;margin-top:7px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Very heavy beads</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:12px;\"><span style=\"min-width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;margin-top:7px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Clearly visible and powerful</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"min-width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;margin-top:7px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Best for deep sadhana and spiritual practice</span></li></ul><h2 style=\"font-weight:700; font-size:20px; margin-top:40px; margin-bottom:20px;\">Does Bigger Mean More Powerful?</h2><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:20px;\">No. The spiritual value of a rudraksha depends more on authenticity, mukhi type, and your intention rather than bead size. Larger beads may feel more powerful physically and visually, but true spiritual connection comes from devotion and genuine practice.</p><h2 style=\"font-weight:700; font-size:20px; margin-top:40px; margin-bottom:20px;\">Conclusion</h2><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:20px;\">Whether you prefer the subtle elegance of 4mm or the commanding presence of 20mm, the right rudraksha mala size depends on your comfort and purpose. Choose what feels natural and aligned with your spiritual goals.</p></div>"
