        "data": "<div style=\"font-family:sans-serif; line-height:1.8; color:#222;\"><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:20px;\">The 11 Mukhi Rudraksha is traditionally associated with strength, clarity, courage, and focused intention. Many people choose it when they are seeking discipline, confidence, or a stronger spiritual foundation in their daily life.</p><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:20px;\">This guide explains who it is generally suited for, how to wear it properly, and what to check before purchasing — in a simple and balanced way.</p><h2 style=\"font-weight:700; font-size:20px; margin-top:40px; margin-bottom:20px;\">What Is 11 Mukhi Rudraksha?</h2><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:20px;\">An 11 Mukhi Rudraksha is a natural bead with eleven distinct lines (mukhis) running from top to bottom. These lines form naturally during the growth of the seed and are not carved or artificially created.</p><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:20px;\">It is traditionally linked to Lord Hanuman and is often associated with courage, protection, and unwavering focus.</p><h2 style=\"font-weight:700; font-size:20px; margin-top:40px; margin-bottom:20px;\">Who Is It For?</h2><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:16px;\">People may consider 11 Mukhi Rudraksha if they are looking for:</p><ul style=\"list-style:none; padding-left:0; margin-bottom:28px;\"><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:12px;\"><span style=\"min-width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;margin-top:7px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Mental strength and confidence</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:12px;\"><span style=\"min-width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;margin-top:7px;\"></span><span styl