        "meta_description": "Verify Rudraksha authenticity in Mauritius! Learn to spot real vs fake Rudraksha, avoid scams, and buy certified spiritual products online safely.",
        "meta_keywords": ["how to verify rudraksha", "rudraksha authenticity", "real vs fake rudraksha", "identify original rudraksha", "rudraksha Mauritius", "avoid scams spiritual products", "certified rudraksha", "safe online spiritual shopping", "buy genuine rudraksha"],
        "data": "<div style=\"font-family:sans-serif; line-height:1.8; color:#222;\"><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:20px;\">Buying spiritual products online is convenient, but it also comes with risks. From fake rudrakshas to uncertified gemstones, scams are common. Whether you are purchasing from Mauritius or anywhere else in the world, knowing how to verify rudraksha authenticity is essential.</p><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:20px;\">This guide explains how to identify original rudraksha, understand real vs fake rudraksha differences, and shop safely online.</p><h2 style=\"font-weight:700; font-size:20px; margin-top:40px; margin-bottom:20px;\">Why Authenticity of Rudraksha or Spiritual Products Matter?</h2><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:16px;\">Spiritual products carry value beyond money. Genuine items support meditation, rituals, and spiritual practices.</p><ul style=\"list-style:none; padding-left:0; margin-bottom:24px;\"><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:12px;\"><span style=\"min-width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;margin-top:7px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Reduced spiritual or healing potential</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:12px;\"><span style=\"min-width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;margin-top:7px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Financial loss</span></li><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"min-width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;margin-top:7px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Disappointment if expectations are not met</span></li></ul><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:20px;\">Always buy certified products from verified sellers to ensure authenticity and effectiveness.</p><h2 style=\"font-weight:700; font-size:20px; margin-top:40px; margin-bottom:20px;\">How To Identify Original Rudraksha?</h2><h3 style=\"font-weight:600; font-size:18px; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:12px;\">1. Appearance Inspection</h3><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:16px;\">Real rudraksha beads have natural grooves (mukhis) running from top to bottom. The surface should feel rough and natural, not polished artificially.</p><h3 style=\"font-weight:600; font-size:18px; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:12px;\">2. Water Test</h3><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:16px;\">Place the bead in water for 24 hours. Genuine rudrakshas typically sink, while many fake ones float. However, this test alone is not fully reliable.</p><h3 style=\"font-weight:600; font-size:18px; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:12px;\">3. Lab Certification</h3><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:16px;\">Certified rudrakshas come with a lab report detailing mukhi count, origin, and authenticity. Always request certification before purchasing.</p><h3 style=\"font-weight:600; font-size:18px; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:12px;\">4. Local Verification in Mauritius</h3><p style=\"font-weight:400; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:20px;\">If you are buying rudraksha in Mauritius, some local stores offer verification services. Cross-checking your online purchase locally adds extra assurance.</p><h2 style=\"font-weight:700; font-size:20px; margin-top:40px; margin-bottom:20px;\">How To Do Safe Spiritual Shopping?</h2><ul style=\"list-style:none; padding-left:0; margin-bottom:24px;\"><li style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:12px;\"><span style=\"min-width:7px;height:7px;background:#6C3E1A;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;margin-top:7px;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;\">Buy from verified sellers wit